{
  "_meta": {
    "notes": "The pad is the bottleneck, and RP-1 says whose fault it is. Vanguard has finished rolling out and is standing on LC-1's only pad, so its rollout operation is gone and the pad still reads Free: `hasVesselWaiting` is the only field that knows, and `waitingVesselName` is the only one that can name the vehicle in the way. Vanguard's own card carries the same sentence as Atlas's, and that is the widget being honest rather than confused: with the operation gone, nothing on the wire ties the name on the pad back to a warehouse row, so the card can say who is in the way and cannot say that it is itself."
